{
    "comment": "상품 폼 — 삭제 확인. 폼이 열기 전에 서버에 물어 둔 삭제 가능 여부(`_global.deleteProduct`)로\n  두 얼굴을 갖는다 — 지울 수 있으면 무엇을 지우는지 보여 주고, 못 지우면 그 사유를 보여 준다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "Product Form - Delete Confirmation Modal"
    },
    "id": "modal_delete_confirm",
    "type": "composite",
    "name": "Modal",
    "props": {
        "title": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.modal.delete.title",
        "size": "sm",
        "footer": [
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Button",
                "actions": [
                    {
                        "type": "click",
                        "handler": "closeModal",
                        "target": "modal_delete_confirm"
                    }
                ],
                "props": {
                    "type": "button",
                    "className": "ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce:bg-white ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-800 ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300 ecommerce:border ecommerce:border-gray-300 ecommerce:dark:border-gray-600 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:hover:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-gray-700 ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                    "disabled": "{{_global.isProductDeleting}}"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.common.cancel"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Button",
                "actions": [
                    {
                        "comment": "삭제 — 성공하면 목록으로 나간다(지워진 상품의 수정 화면에 남아 있을 수 없다). 진행 표시를 전역에 두는 것은 창과 그 뒤 폼이 같은 값을 봐야 하기 때문이다",
                        "type": "click",
                        "handler": "sequence",
                        "actions": [
                            {
                                "handler": "setState",
                                "params": {
                                    "target": "global",
                                    "isProductDeleting": true
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "handler": "apiCall",
                                "target": "/api/modules/sirsoft-ecommerce/admin/products/{{route.itemCode}}",
                                "auth_required": true,
                                "params": {
                                    "method": "DELETE"
                                },
                                "onSuccess": [
                                    {
                                        "handler": "setState",
                                        "params": {
                                            "target": "global",
                                            "isProductDeleting": false
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "closeModal",
                                        "target": "modal_delete_confirm"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "toast",
                                        "params": {
                                            "type": "success",
                                            "message": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.messages.deleted_success"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "navigate",
                                        "params": {
                                            "bypassLeaveGuard": true,
                                            "path": "/admin/ecommerce/products",
                                            "mergeQuery": true,
                                            "query": {}
                                        }
                                    }
                                ],
                                "onError": [
                                    {
                                        "handler": "setState",
                                        "params": {
                                            "target": "global",
                                            "isProductDeleting": false
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "toast",
                                        "params": {
                                            "type": "error",
                                            "message": "{{error.message ?? '$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.messages.deleted_error'}}"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "props": {
                    "type": "button",
                    "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:gap-2 ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce:bg-red-600 ecommerce:dark:bg-red-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:hover:bg-red-700 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-red-700 ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                    "disabled": "{{!_global.deleteProduct?.canDelete || _global.isProductDeleting}}"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Icon",
                        "if": "{{_global.isProductDeleting}}",
                        "props": {
                            "name": "spinner",
                            "className": "ecommerce-spinner-sm"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "text": "{{_global.isProductDeleting ? '$t:common.deleting' : '$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.modal.delete.confirm_button'}}"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "comment": "삭제 가능 분기 — 목록 모달과 동일하게 can-delete 선행 결과로 분기",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "if": "{{_global.deleteProduct?.canDelete}}",
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce:text-center"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:w-16 ecommerce:h-16 ecommerce:mx-auto ecommerce:mb-4 ecommerce:rounded-full ecommerce:bg-red-100 ecommerce:dark:bg-red-900/30 ecommerce:justify-center"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "triangle-exclamation",
                                        "className": "ecommerce:text-[2rem] ecommerce:text-red-500 ecommerce:dark:text-red-400"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-text-primary ecommerce:text-lg ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:mb-2"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.modal.delete.confirm_question"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-800 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:p-3 ecommerce:mb-4"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:justify-center ecommerce:gap-3"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "if": "{{_local.form.images?.length > 0}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:w-10 ecommerce:h-10 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:overflow-hidden ecommerce:flex-shrink-0"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Img",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "src": "{{_local.form.images?.[0]?.preview_url ?? _local.form.images?.[0]?.download_url}}",
                                                        "thumbPreset": "sm",
                                                        "loading": "lazy",
                                                        "decoding": "async",
                                                        "alt": "",
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:w-full ecommerce:h-full ecommerce:object-cover"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "if": "{{!_local.form.images?.length}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:w-10 ecommerce:h-10 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:bg-gray-200 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-700 ecommerce:justify-center ecommerce:flex-shrink-0"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "name": "image",
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:text-xl ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:text-left"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "P",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce-text-primary ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:text-sm"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{$localized(_local.form.name)}}"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "P",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce-text-tertiary"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{_local.form.product_code ?? ''}}"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-text-label-subtle"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.modal.delete.warning_message"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-alert-warning"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-flex-start ecommerce:gap-2"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Icon",
                                            "props": {
                                                "name": "exclamation-circle",
                                                "className": "ecommerce:text-base ecommerce:text-yellow-700 ecommerce:dark:text-yellow-400 ecommerce:flex-shrink-0 ecommerce:mt-0.5"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "P",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce-tone-warning-soft ecommerce:text-left ecommerce:text-xs"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.modal.delete.permanent_warning"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "comment": "삭제 불가 분기 — 주문 이력 등으로 삭제 불가 시 사유 노출",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "if": "{{_global.deleteProduct?.canDelete === false}}",
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "composite",
                    "name": "Alert",
                    "props": {
                        "type": "error",
                        "title": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.product.modal.delete.cannot_delete_title",
                        "message": "{{_global.deleteProduct?.reason}}"
                    }
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
